  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding from AK Amrix Criteria Version 2. Original 05/28/2009; last updated/Approved 09/19/2014. No explicit effective date is stated; effective_date uses approval date 2014-09-19 instead of the ingestion placeholder 2024-06-01.",
    "Approval criterion 1 is an alternate pharmacy PA override for hospice, cancer or LTC; it waives approval criteria 2–4. The separately listed hyperthyroidism and concurrent MAOI denial criteria apply on both paths.",
    "Indication: adjunct to rest and physical therapy for relief of muscle spasm associated with acute, painful musculoskeletal conditions.",
    "Limitations (notes only): use for short periods up to 2–3 weeks; not found effective for spasticity or cerebral palsy.",
    "Duration and quantity (notes only): dispensing limit 21 capsules / 21 days; approve 21 days only; no refills; a new PA must be requested for each 21 day supply. Duration, quantity and use limitations remain manual review."
  ],
